  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 5.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.82,
      "end_seconds": 14.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.62,
      "end_seconds": 24.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "It's burning when I pass urine, mostly. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 27.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.65,
      "end_seconds": 32.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Probably about four days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.16,
      "end_seconds": 37.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "So, how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.34,
      "end_seconds": 40.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I'd say all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.78,
      "end_seconds": 44.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.45,
      "end_seconds": 62.83,
      "duration_seconds": 17.38,
      "text": "A dull ache low in my tummy goes along with it, most of the time. Okay, you know, so with dull ache low in my tummy, I'd say once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.7,
      "end_seconds": 67.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "And blood in the urine, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.05,
      "end_seconds": 73.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "No. No blood in the urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.57,
      "end_seconds": 77.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Alright, any back pain or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.14,
      "end_seconds": 81.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.39,
      "end_seconds": 85.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.71,
      "end_seconds": 90.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.82,
      "end_seconds": 95.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.53,
      "end_seconds": 98.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.36,
      "end_seconds": 101.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.81,
      "end_seconds": 107.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.64,
      "end_seconds": 111.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.01,
      "end_seconds": 125.18,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.84,
      "end_seconds": 144.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.39,
      "end_seconds": 149.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.36,
      "end_seconds": 168.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.45,
      "end_seconds": 179.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "Yes, amoxicillin. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.05,
      "end_seconds": 192.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.63,
      "end_seconds": 204.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "So, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.24,
      "end_seconds": 227.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, pulse is 82 beats a minute. And temp 36.7 degrees, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, BP is 112 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.07,
      "end_seconds": 233.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.92,
      "end_seconds": 236.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.75,
      "end_seconds": 257.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with slight tenderness just above the pubic bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.43,
      "end_seconds": 275.85,
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. So where does that leave us? This looks most like an uncomplicated urinary infection. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.07,
      "end_seconds": 310.56,
      "duration_seconds": 22.49,
      "text": "I think a urine dipstick makes sense here, for burning urine. We'll begin with nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. You take it by mouth. That's for urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and avoid holding urine. Right, tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.59,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.84,
      "end_seconds": 324.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.82,
      "end_seconds": 328.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.24,
      "end_seconds": 333.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}